==Icelandic==

===Alternative spellings===
* [[ðú]] {{italbrac|archaic}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|þú|lang=non}}, from {{proto|Indo-European|túh₂|lang=ang}}. Cognate with Old Frisian {{term|thu}}, Old Saxon ''þu'' (Low German {{term|du|lang=nds}}), Old High German {{term|thu|thū|lang=goh}} (German {{term|du|lang=de}}), Gothic {{term|𐌸𐌿|lang=got}}, Latin {{term|tu|lang=la}} (French and Italian {{term|tu}}, Spanish {{term|tú|lang=es}}), Greek {{term|σi|tr=sý|lang=el}}, Lithuanian {{term|tu|tù|lang=lt}}, Old Church Slavonic {{term|sc=Cyrl|тъі|tr=ty|lang=cu}} (Russian {{term|sc=Cyrl|ты|tr=ty|lang=ru}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ˈθuː]|lang=is}}
* {{audio|Þú.ogg|audio}}

===Pronoun===
'''þú'''{{i-c|personal pronoun}}

# {{singular}} [[you]], [[thou]]
#: '''''Þú''' [[vera#Icelandic|ert]] [[skemmtilegur]].''
#:: '''You''' [[are]] [[fun]].
#: ''Er'''tu''' nemandi?''
#:: Are '''you''' a student?

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|singular you, ye}} [[þér]] {{italbrac|formal|archaic}}

====Derived terms====
* [[ertu]]
* [[þúbróðir]]/[[þúnautur]]
* [[þúa]]
* [[þú og hvaða her]]

====Usage notes====
* After verbs the pronoun {{term|þú|lang=is}} is either:
*: separated:
*:: {{italbrac|separated}} {{term||munt '''þú'''|are '''you''' going to}}
*:: {{italbrac|separated}} {{term||skalt '''þú'''|'''you''' shall}}
*:: {{italbrac|separated}} {{term||borðar '''þú'''|do '''you''' eat}}
*:: {{italbrac|separated}} {{term||hoppar '''þú'''|do '''you''' jump}}
*:: {{italbrac|separated}} {{term||sérð '''þú'''|do '''you''' see|lang=is}}
*: or suffixed and changed into {{term|-ðu|lang=is}}, {{term|-du|lang=is}}, {{term|-tu|lang=is}} or {{term|-u|lang=is}}:
*:: {{italbrac|suffixed}} {{term||mun'''tu'''|are '''you''' going to|lang=is}}
*:: {{italbrac|suffixed}} {{term||borðar'''ðu'''|do '''you''' eat|lang=is}}
*:: {{italbrac|suffixed}} {{term||munt'''þú'''|will '''you'''|lang=is}}
*:: {{italbrac|suffixed}} {{term||vil'''tu'''|do '''you''' want to|lang=is}}
*:: {{italbrac|suffixed}} {{term||nennir'''ðu'''|could '''you''' be bothered to|lang=is}}

